Start with [Getting started]($link.page('docs/getting-started')), then build a complete app in the [tutorial]($link.page('docs/tutorial')).

For mobile apps, see [Android and iOS]($link.page('docs/mobile')). Add native
Android behavior and SDK integrations with
[app-owned Android extensions]($link.page('docs/android-extensions')).
